# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CRYPTOGRAPHED STORAGE & SECRETS - never commit. Defense in depth: these paths
# are excluded from the git project by design; deploy keeps them REAL & in place.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/encrypted/
*.enc
*.enc.*
*.pre-luks
.root_key
**/*master-key*
# TLS material and any private keys / certs
**/certs/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
# generic secret files
.env
.env.*
*secret*
*.secret

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build artifacts (Rust) - the service runs target/release/allumeur-backend, but
# the build output is never tracked; deploy keeps a real, writable target/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/target/
/backend/target/

# Packaging output (built .deb / tarball) and the Nix build symlink.
/dist/
/result
/result-*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vendored / fetched binaries - cloudflared (~39MB) is downloaded by deploy,
# never committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scripts/binaries/
**/cloudflared

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime state
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
allumeur_tunnels/
*.bak
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Analysis scratch (kept out of the repo)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.analysis/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
# live-deployment doc with real topology - excluded
scripts/handover.md

# stray test capture
local_err
